& [Observed]
  + the published deployment harness placed transport.zip inside the exact local evidence root and removed it only in the outer finally block
  + the independent evidence verifier executes before that finally block and requires exactly five declared evidence files, so a successful remote replay would have been refused locally because transport.zip remained as a sixth file

& [Timing]
  + detected during the final pre-live code-path audit after implementation publication and before the first remote archive transfer or EVO-X2 pilot-root write

& [Correction]
  + delete only the locally generated transport.zip immediately after the remote install-and-replay response passes and before retrieving any of the five evidence artifacts
  + retain the outer finally deletion as failure-path cleanup and add a static ordering gate proving deletion precedes receipt retrieval

& [Boundary]
